12126.d:
Take a piece of paper, sharpen the pencil and start doodling whatever comes to mind

'Mind scribbles' simulates hand-drawn strokes, with pencil and ink. The colors are inspired by ancient oriental arts. 

- 10 color palettes;
- Margin or no margin;
- There may be a circular pattern in the center or a negative circular space;
- There may be a rectangular pattern in the center or a negative rectangular space;
- Press 's' on live mode to save in PNG hi-res;

April 2022, @gpitombo

12217.d:
The program generates blurring, shifting, bending and distorting of various distributions of the uniform input image. The alternator formula containing time variables, XOR operators and constant variables changes every frame depend on numbers given by the hash. A one random color of the input image is the source of all colors in the composition. The most saturated background colors are logarithmically rare.

 FEATURES

🌈 Saturation: {low, medium, high}
Starting time: {0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8}
Range: {0, ¼, ½, ¾, 1}
Alternator module: {2, 3, 4, 5, 6}
Height: {low, medium, high}
Angle: {-45°, 90°, 45°}
Curvature ratio: {-1, -½, -¼, -⅛, ⅛, ¼, ½, 1}
Edge fractalization: {1, 2, 4, 8, 16, ...}
Horizontal velocity and sense: {-2 -1, 1, 2}
Vertical velocity: {0, ¼, ½, ¾, 1}
Extender: {-16, -15, -14, ..., -1, 1, 2, 3, ..., 16}
Local side: {left, right}
 
Krzysztof Proembrion Syruć
April 29 2022, Gdańsk, Poland
